port multimedia/nymphcastlib
type port
reason "DragonFly: take the Makefile's FreeBSD branch (LOCALBASE include/lib paths)"

# dragonfly/@<line>/patch-Makefile-dragonfly (after FreeBSD's patch-Makefile):
